# Entry Main: a typed place of a declaration (`size_t: r 0U`) is a value cell of its row, named at its cell. The
# explicit path writes and reads it: r takes the value of n, 3000000000, which the int projection cannot carry.
# r 3000000000, n 3000000000.
size_t: r 0U
size_t: n 3000000000U
---
Main:
    node\r := node\n
